    "@value" : "0.10.0 (decision D9, 2026-10-12): definition widened to policy statements."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A description of a condition under which a legal instrument, one of its provisions or a policy statement applies to an organisation or part of it, such as its territory, organisation type, sector, role in processing personal information, a threshold or, for a policy statement, a role or asset category, written as a CRGO paraphrase or the organisation's own wording, with its citation and a machine-readable test."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fr",
    "@value" : "Description d'une condition à laquelle un instrument juridique, l'une de ses dispositions ou un énoncé de politique s'applique à une organisation ou à une partie de celle-ci, comme son territoire, son type d'organisation, son secteur, son rôle dans le traitement de renseignements personnels, un seuil ou, pour un énoncé de politique, un rôle ou une catégorie d'actifs, rédigée comme une paraphrase de CRGO ou dans les termes de l'organisation, avec sa citation et un test lisible par machine."
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Conditions are evaluated over an organisation profile, never asserted as class membership (specification section 9)."
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "CQLR c. P-39.1 ss. 1, 3.1-3.8, 17, 18.3; CQLR c. A-2.1 s. 3; CQLR c. R-22.1 s. 4 (LégisQuébec, updated to 2026-08-12)"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "CRGO v0.8 to v1.0 Claude Implementation Specification (project owner, 2026-10-11), sections 3-13"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "OSFI Guideline B-13, scope (federally regulated financial institutions), 2022-07-31"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "PIPEDA ss. 4, 26(2)(b), Sch. 1 (S.C. 2000, c. 5, current to 2026-09-21)"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Regulation (EU) 2016/679, Arts. 3, 4, 24, 28, 30 (OJ L 119, 4.5.2016)"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290" : [ {
    "@type" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
    "@value" : "2026-10-11"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291" : [ {
    "@value" : "0.9.0"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000345",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "applicability assessment"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fr",
    "@value" : "évaluation de l'applicabilité"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000853"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000346"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "0.10.0 (decision D9, 2026-10-12): definition widened to policy statements."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A dated record (not the act of assessing) of whether a legal instrument, provision or policy statement applies to a given organisation or part of it, giving the state reached (applicable, not applicable, potentially applicable or unknown) and the conditions found met, not met or undetermined."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fr",
    "@value" : "Enregistrement daté indiquant si un instrument juridique, une disposition ou un énoncé de politique s'applique à une organisation donnée ou à une partie de celle-ci, avec l'état retenu (applicable, non applicable, potentiellement applicable ou inconnu) et les conditions jugées remplies, non remplies ou indéterminées."
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Specification section 9 states; 'unknown' when a needed fact is absent, so missing data never yields 'not applicable'."
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "CRGO v0.8 to v1.0 Claude Implementation Specification (project owner, 2026-10-11), sections 3-13"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290" : [ {
    "@type" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
    "@value" : "2026-10-11"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291" : [ {
    "@value" : "0.9.0"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000346",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "compliance determination"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fr",
    "@value" : "constat de conformité"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000853"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000504"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000511"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000541"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000891"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000912"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "compliance assessment"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "0.10.0 (2026-10-12): definition widened to contractual obligations and adopted framework requirements (improvement I4)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A dated record, made by an identified assessor, of the extent to which a given organisation satisfies a legal provision or obligation, a contractual obligation or a requirement of a framework it has adopted, with the evidence relied on or an explicit statement of the missing evidence. A mapped control or framework requirement is not by itself evidence of compliance."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fr",
    "@value" : "Enregistrement daté, établi par un évaluateur identifié, du degré auquel une organisation donnée satisfait à une disposition ou à une obligation légale, à une obligation contractuelle ou à une exigence d'un référentiel qu'elle a adopté, avec les preuves retenues ou un énoncé explicite des preuves manquantes. Un contrôle ou une exigence de référentiel mis en correspondance ne constitue pas à lui seul une preuve de conformité."
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Specification sections 9 and 13 (state, assessor, date, evidence or evidence gap)."
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "CRGO v0.8 to v1.0 Claude Implementation Specification (project owner, 2026-10-11), sections 3-13"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290" : [ {
    "@type" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
    "@value" : "2026-10-12"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291" : [ {
    "@value" : "0.9.0"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000292" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "P1 review group 6: changes to approved terms beyond D9 (reopens finding, version label, audit finding, policy statement, legal instrument, compliance determination)"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000347",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "control assessment"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fr",
    "@value" : "évaluation d'une mesure de sécurité"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000228"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "control test"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A planned act in which an assessor tests or reviews a control measure of an organisation at a stated date, over a stated scope and by a stated procedure, and records its result and the evidence gathered."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fr",
    "@value" : "Acte planifié par lequel un évaluateur teste ou examine une mesure de sécurité d'une organisation à une date, sur un périmètre et selon une procédure donnés, et en consigne le résultat et les preuves recueillies."
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Specification section 5 (separate objective, implementation and assessment result): control = objective, control measure = implementation, control assessment = test."
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "CRGO v0.8 to v1.0 Claude Implementation Specification (project owner, 2026-10-11), sections 3-13"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "NIST SP 800-30 Rev. 1 (2012), Appendices D-I (threat sources, events, vulnerabilities and predisposing conditions, likelihood, impact, risk)"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290" : [ {
    "@type" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
    "@value" : "2026-10-11"
  } ],
  "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291" : [ {
    "@value" : "0.9.0"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000348",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "fr",
    "@value" : "juridiction"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "jurisdiction"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A territory whose law or regulator CRGO's legal vocabularies come from, used to state where an organisation is established, offers services or has data subjects."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fr",
    "@value" : "Territoire dont proviennent le droit ou l'autorité de réglementation des vocabulaires juridiques de CRGO, servant à indiquer où une organisation est établie, offre des services ou compte des personnes concernées."
  } ],
