    "@language" : "fr",
    "@value" : "Plan par lequel une organisation exploite son système de management de la conformité : son périmètre, les obligations et engagements qu'il couvre, ses objectifs, les rôles en cause et son cycle de revue."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The plan by which an organisation operates its compliance management system: its scope, the obligations and commitments it covers, its objectives, the roles involved and its review cycle."
  } ],
